{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42595","headline":"送廖融处士南游 · 翁宏","name":"送廖融处士南游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病卧瘴云间，莓苔渍竹关。\n孤吟牛渚月，老忆洞庭山。\n壮志潜消尽，淳风竟未还。\n今朝忽相遇，执手一开颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁宏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}